  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'LUNAR CAPTURE

    Eight full tractors compete under one-sixth gravity.
    Drive to an actual loose flag and press ACTION while touching it to connect your
    cargo spring. Return slowly to YOUR numbered glowing station; the real flag must
    enter its volume, settle near the truck rack and remain there for half a second.
    Every valid delivery scores +1; repeated contact cannot score twice. Strong physical
    collisions can detach your cargo for anyone to recover. ACTION on bare ground
    performs a bounded hop. Hold ACTION in the air: driving fore/aft controls pitch,
    left/right controls roll/yaw, and limited jets soften descent. Fuel is finite
    and recharges only on wheel contact; jets cannot hover. NWH still owns the wheels,
    motor and suspension. Marked crater ramps offer shortcuts; navigate the rim if
    you lack hop fuel. Orange circles warn of actual meteors for three seconds: clear
    the area before the rock arrives. First to the chosen captures wins; at five
    minutes the actual highest score wins, including ties. A tractor stranded upside
    down or outside the field for ten seconds returns to its last safe ground position
    and drops its flag without score. Use standard pause, reconnect, views and rematch
    menus.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
